<!-- DISCOVERY -->
<section class="card" id="discovery">
  <div class="kicker">Prerequisite — Phase 1</div>
  <h2>Four questions before any ingestion architecture is committed</h2>

  <div class="callout danger">
    <strong>Q1 now requires three buckets, not one.</strong> Previous versions asked only "which fields exist in Analytics Platform?" v0.5 corrects this. The field coverage analysis must distinguish: fields already in Analytics Platform Gold (immediately consumable with no new work), fields in Analytics Platform Silver but not Gold (Product Information Platform — a promotion gap, internal work only), and fields absent from Analytics Platform entirely (Source B — requires new Bronze ingestion). The bucket a field falls into determines its entire delivery path, effort, and team dependency.
  </div>

