<!-- AS-IS -->
<div class="phase-header as-is">
  <h2>&#128203; Current State — As-Is</h2>
  <p>Product Aggregation Service aggregates multiple upstream APIs · DS squads consume from both Analytics Platform Gold and aggregation-service-fed stores · Product Information Platform sits in Silver unused by squads · No Consumer Analytics Data Product Gold layer exists</p>
