        <tr><td><span class="pro">Full Bronze-retained history by design.</span> Bronze managed tables are immutable and retained. 2–3 year daily history for model back-testing is a structural property, not an afterthought.</td><td><span class="con">Silver assembly logic becomes Analytics Platform's responsibility.</span> The join across Product Information Platform, Enterprise Resource Platform / Product Lifecycle Platform, Pricing, Inventory and Promotions that Product Aggregation Service currently performs moves into Analytics Platform Silver conform data-processing jobs. Bounded engineering work, but real.</td></tr>
